WEBVTT

00:00:02.080 --> 00:00:09.170
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:01:37.860 --> 00:01:39.360
My name is Silang.

00:01:40.910 --> 00:01:42.810
Mao, Meili and I originally planed

00:01:42.900 --> 00:01:43.640
to head the next place as

00:01:43.690 --> 00:01:45.520
a part of our journey.

00:01:46.610 --> 00:01:48.580
Where are we now?

00:01:50.260 --> 00:01:51.790
Since we lost contact with Mao,

00:01:52.230 --> 00:01:53.170
we had been in the forest

00:01:53.220 --> 00:01:54.320
for two days.

00:02:16.310 --> 00:02:17.980
Let go of me!

00:02:21.150 --> 00:02:23.010
I thought I'm done.

00:02:23.180 --> 00:02:26.310
Where the hell is Mao?

00:02:28.750 --> 00:02:32.190
Scary Red Congee: Secret of the Haunted Mansion

00:02:39.220 --> 00:02:41.630
Look, that looks like a grave.

00:02:42.230 --> 00:02:43.370
Maybe.

00:02:43.620 --> 00:02:45.120
It's all your fault!

00:02:45.510 --> 00:02:46.550
You said we went this way

00:02:46.600 --> 00:02:47.890
and we can find the way out.

00:02:48.200 --> 00:02:50.290
Now we are trapped.

00:02:50.500 --> 00:02:52.770
I'm not!

00:02:52.890 --> 00:02:54.030
By the way,

00:02:54.080 --> 00:02:55.900
you were always so slow

00:02:55.950 --> 00:02:57.550
so we couldn't keep up with Mao!

00:02:58.860 --> 00:02:59.420
What?

00:02:59.470 --> 00:03:00.360
A ghost?

00:03:15.500 --> 00:03:17.050
It's the butt this time.

00:03:17.090 --> 00:03:19.960
You thought I like that?

00:03:35.290 --> 00:03:37.980
We should have some rest.

00:03:39.560 --> 00:03:41.990
Where are we?

00:03:42.470 --> 00:03:44.140
So familiar.

00:03:46.190 --> 00:03:48.010
We have been here just now.

00:03:49.610 --> 00:03:50.550
What's that!

00:03:51.220 --> 00:03:53.140
What? A cat.

00:03:53.450 --> 00:03:54.780
I can't stand this.

00:03:54.900 --> 00:03:57.470
We must stay here?

00:03:58.970 --> 00:04:00.340
Look, there's light.

00:04:02.900 --> 00:04:04.340
I didn't expect that someone will live here.

00:04:05.300 --> 00:04:06.510
Let’s go and have a look.

00:04:06.610 --> 00:04:07.740
Maybe we can stay there.

00:04:08.670 --> 00:04:10.320
Wait!

00:04:16.640 --> 00:04:18.460
A big house!

00:04:18.840 --> 00:04:20.390
Why is it in the forest?

00:04:20.730 --> 00:04:22.950
Anyway, let's go in.

00:04:27.920 --> 00:04:29.260
It's wind!

00:04:31.350 --> 00:04:32.270
What?

00:04:33.080 --> 00:04:34.220
You first.

00:04:34.680 --> 00:04:36.100
Coward!

00:04:43.800 --> 00:04:45.050
It seems that nobody is there.

00:04:45.130 --> 00:04:46.330
Impossible.

00:04:46.410 --> 00:04:48.150
We saw light.

00:04:48.770 --> 00:04:50.540
The house is old.

00:04:51.200 --> 00:04:53.120
As if something would come out.

00:04:54.320 --> 00:04:55.130
What thing?

00:04:55.180 --> 00:04:55.860
What thing?

00:04:56.760 --> 00:04:58.020
Ghost!

00:04:58.430 --> 00:05:00.070
It says good night to you.

00:05:00.110 --> 00:05:01.100
Good night.

00:05:02.920 --> 00:05:03.890
It comes out!

00:05:04.770 --> 00:05:05.630
Beat it!

00:05:06.620 --> 00:05:08.410
Monster!

00:05:08.490 --> 00:05:10.410
It hurts! Stop!

00:05:10.460 --> 00:05:11.730
It hurts!

00:05:13.580 --> 00:05:14.420
You guys!

00:05:14.750 --> 00:05:16.470
Look! I'm not a ghost!

00:05:17.000 --> 00:05:17.820
Mao!

00:05:18.390 --> 00:05:19.520
It's you!

00:05:19.780 --> 00:05:21.150
That hurt!

00:05:21.400 --> 00:05:23.210
How did you find us here?

00:05:23.460 --> 00:05:24.750
I saw light coming from here,

00:05:24.940 --> 00:05:26.150
so I thought you two

00:05:26.200 --> 00:05:27.710
might be here.

00:05:27.930 --> 00:05:28.550
Mao!

00:05:28.660 --> 00:05:30.540
Where have you been for those days?

00:05:30.590 --> 00:05:32.740
We keep finding you!

00:05:32.790 --> 00:05:33.740
You idiot!

00:05:39.010 --> 00:05:40.740
Look! Lights?

00:05:45.780 --> 00:05:47.440
They're coming this way.

00:05:53.560 --> 00:05:55.030
It's going to be fine.

00:06:03.930 --> 00:06:06.790
Can I help you?

00:06:08.880 --> 00:06:10.270
We...

00:06:10.370 --> 00:06:11.730
We got lost.

00:06:12.830 --> 00:06:13.360
If you don't mind,

00:06:13.410 --> 00:06:14.080
could you please let us

00:06:14.130 --> 00:06:16.180
stay here for one night?

00:06:16.230 --> 00:06:17.350
And give us some food.

00:06:17.590 --> 00:06:19.430
Maybe let us take a shower?

00:06:22.370 --> 00:06:23.550
If you mind,

00:06:23.590 --> 00:06:25.190
could you please just give us

00:06:25.240 --> 00:06:26.610
some leftovers?

00:06:27.330 --> 00:06:30.890
I'm Kocho, the owner of this house.

00:06:31.270 --> 00:06:32.080
It's hard to find your way

00:06:32.130 --> 00:06:33.110
at this time of night

00:06:33.230 --> 00:06:34.940
in the forest.

00:06:35.870 --> 00:06:38.050
We are about to have dinner.

00:06:38.860 --> 00:06:39.660
If you don't mind,

00:06:39.820 --> 00:06:41.410
please come in and eat with us.

00:06:41.600 --> 00:06:42.200
Really?

00:06:42.320 --> 00:06:43.980
Sure!

00:06:44.360 --> 00:06:45.980
This way, please.

00:06:52.870 --> 00:06:55.320
Horrible.

00:06:55.750 --> 00:06:57.940
This place is creepy.

00:07:18.080 --> 00:07:18.780
I'm the chef at your service.

00:07:18.800 --> 00:07:20.740
of this house.

00:07:21.190 --> 00:07:22.950
My name is Gien.

00:07:26.120 --> 00:07:28.540
I'd like you to have some bird's nest soup
as an appetizer.

00:07:28.590 --> 00:07:30.290
Please have a try.

00:07:30.640 --> 00:07:31.660
I also have chicken

00:07:31.700 --> 00:07:33.260
with raw vegetables.

00:07:33.760 --> 00:07:34.880
Mr. Gien,

00:07:35.260 --> 00:07:36.880
Where's the congee we always have?

00:07:37.120 --> 00:07:38.210
Congee?

00:07:43.370 --> 00:07:44.480
Don't worry, sir.

00:07:44.580 --> 00:07:47.330
I'll serve it after the main dish.

00:07:47.440 --> 00:07:50.020
That's fine, then.

00:07:57.130 --> 00:07:59.590
This is delicious!

00:08:04.230 --> 00:08:05.080
Weird.

00:08:05.660 --> 00:08:06.210
These two

00:08:06.260 --> 00:08:08.110
seem not willing to eat.

00:08:15.270 --> 00:08:16.840
For our finale,

00:08:17.300 --> 00:08:20.030
please have some of my special congee.

00:08:27.300 --> 00:08:27.850
Red.

00:08:29.890 --> 00:08:31.420
The congee is red.

00:08:32.070 --> 00:08:33.400
So red.

00:08:34.640 --> 00:08:36.010
That's what I want.

00:08:48.500 --> 00:08:49.970
Their looks

00:08:50.290 --> 00:08:51.130
are so strange.

00:08:53.410 --> 00:08:53.960
This is...

00:09:11.270 --> 00:09:12.150
You guys,

00:09:12.490 --> 00:09:13.410
please take a rest

00:09:13.460 --> 00:09:15.700
at the last room in this corridor.

00:09:24.980 --> 00:09:25.660
It's okay.

00:09:26.600 --> 00:09:28.110
What happened?

00:09:28.720 --> 00:09:29.520
Yeah.

00:09:29.620 --> 00:09:31.380
You told us not to eat the red congee.

00:09:32.470 --> 00:09:33.050
You were really good

00:09:33.100 --> 00:09:35.050
in pretending to have eaten it.

00:09:35.730 --> 00:09:37.620
I think nobody would suspect a thing.

00:09:37.890 --> 00:09:39.970
Is there anything wrong with that congee?

00:09:41.980 --> 00:09:42.590
Yes.

00:09:44.900 --> 00:09:46.260
We can check it out

00:09:46.560 --> 00:09:47.780
after everyone's asleep.

00:09:58.780 --> 00:09:59.650
What?

00:09:59.770 --> 00:10:01.450
What if we are discovered?

00:10:01.830 --> 00:10:03.630
How can we go into the kitchen without permission?

00:10:03.930 --> 00:10:05.690
I have to find out the problem.

00:10:06.500 --> 00:10:08.220
If I'm correct,

00:10:08.350 --> 00:10:09.900
I should be able to find that thing in here.

00:10:14.590 --> 00:10:15.490
Don't yell!

00:10:15.730 --> 00:10:16.770
Be quiet!

00:10:17.600 --> 00:10:19.160
But, look at this!

00:10:31.330 --> 00:10:32.300
Snakes!

00:10:32.940 --> 00:10:34.200
Snakes!

00:10:34.250 --> 00:10:36.040
Does that congee's red color

00:10:36.090 --> 00:10:37.660
comes from the snake's blood?

00:10:38.580 --> 00:10:41.630
But that's not what I'm finding.

00:10:56.270 --> 00:10:56.910
This is it.

00:10:57.970 --> 00:10:58.860
What's that?

00:10:59.490 --> 00:11:00.240
A mushroom?

00:11:20.670 --> 00:11:22.260
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:11:32.330 --> 00:11:33.890
Help! The ghost caught me!

00:11:35.070 --> 00:11:35.610
Silang!

00:11:39.490 --> 00:11:40.570
What's going on?

00:11:45.290 --> 00:11:47.400
She is not a ghost. She's a human.

00:11:48.090 --> 00:11:49.630
Yeah, she has feet!

00:11:53.530 --> 00:11:55.240
So you're Miss Lan?

00:11:55.580 --> 00:11:56.920
Are you Kocho's daughter?

00:11:58.270 --> 00:12:00.050
You don't look so good.

00:12:00.130 --> 00:12:01.570
Do you eat properly?

00:12:02.430 --> 00:12:04.090
Could you tell us what's going on?

00:12:05.190 --> 00:12:06.970
Why didn't you come to dinner?

00:12:07.490 --> 00:12:08.240
Because...

00:12:08.780 --> 00:12:11.100
If I have to eat that red congee,

00:12:11.640 --> 00:12:12.980
I’d rather eat nothing.

00:12:14.340 --> 00:12:15.960
Who is that chef

00:12:16.110 --> 00:12:16.970
named Gien?

00:12:18.040 --> 00:12:20.230
That's because of him!

00:12:21.750 --> 00:12:24.660
Since he came to our home,

00:12:25.300 --> 00:12:27.190
it became so strange here.

00:12:30.980 --> 00:12:34.160
We were quite wealthy

00:12:34.550 --> 00:12:35.920
thanks to the jade we mined nearby.

00:12:36.500 --> 00:12:38.130
That's why this house is called

00:12:38.180 --> 00:12:39.740
\"The Jade Mansion.\"

00:12:42.380 --> 00:12:44.500
About half a year ago,

00:12:45.340 --> 00:12:47.720
a wandering cook came to our house.

00:12:48.240 --> 00:12:49.100
My father, who is a kind person,

00:12:49.150 --> 00:12:50.380
let him stay.

00:12:51.590 --> 00:12:53.670
He was Gien.

00:12:55.550 --> 00:12:56.640
He said he

00:12:56.680 --> 00:12:58.960
was a chef in a noble family.

00:12:59.560 --> 00:13:02.510
The food he made

00:13:02.850 --> 00:13:05.120
had won my parents' heart at the beginning.

00:13:07.950 --> 00:13:09.450
And then he served us

00:13:09.580 --> 00:13:11.220
that red congee.

00:13:28.950 --> 00:13:30.420
I tried to break my addiction to

00:13:30.560 --> 00:13:32.900
the red congee,

00:13:33.380 --> 00:13:34.110
so I locked myself

00:13:34.160 --> 00:13:36.390
in my room this week.

00:13:38.360 --> 00:13:40.950
So the scream we heard was yours...

00:13:41.550 --> 00:13:42.910
But no matter how I refuse,

00:13:42.990 --> 00:13:45.000
my body still wants

00:13:45.050 --> 00:13:46.270
that red congee.

00:13:47.220 --> 00:13:49.320
I really have no idea.

00:13:52.260 --> 00:13:54.730
What does that guy want?

00:13:54.880 --> 00:13:56.020
We cannot let this keep happening.

00:13:57.580 --> 00:13:58.200
Right.

00:14:00.240 --> 00:14:01.470
We have to do something!

00:14:06.170 --> 00:14:07.910
I want congee!

00:14:08.440 --> 00:14:10.630
The red one!

00:14:12.140 --> 00:14:13.530
Congee...

00:14:13.740 --> 00:14:15.650
You can have all the congee you want,

00:14:15.770 --> 00:14:17.140
after you sign

00:14:17.180 --> 00:14:18.270
this document.

00:14:20.610 --> 00:14:21.400
But...

00:14:23.410 --> 00:14:24.140
If you don't sign it

00:14:24.190 --> 00:14:25.510
as I told,

00:14:26.600 --> 00:14:29.180
you won't be able

00:14:29.280 --> 00:14:31.730
to eat the congee...

00:14:33.990 --> 00:14:35.190
I understand.

00:14:35.780 --> 00:14:37.890
Give me the congee.

00:14:38.280 --> 00:14:39.820
I'll sign the paper now.

00:14:40.530 --> 00:14:41.110
Really.

00:14:41.810 --> 00:14:45.600
I beg you, please give me the congee!

00:14:52.040 --> 00:14:53.440
It took six months,

00:14:53.520 --> 00:14:55.160
but all of the wealth in this house

00:14:55.210 --> 00:14:56.290
will finally be mine!

00:14:56.990 --> 00:14:58.110
I'll give them a final dose

00:14:58.160 --> 00:15:00.570
of the congee they want.

00:15:09.550 --> 00:15:11.060
What are you doing?

00:15:11.450 --> 00:15:12.920
We want to thank the master for letting us stay.

00:15:13.070 --> 00:15:14.440
I want to make breakfast for them.

00:15:15.530 --> 00:15:16.720
I'm still learning.

00:15:17.090 --> 00:15:19.660
so I appreciate any criticism you can give me!

00:15:38.460 --> 00:15:41.230
It's rare to see you use clay pots.

00:15:44.270 --> 00:15:46.790
The pots suits the cooking of congee.

00:15:47.170 --> 00:15:48.870
Heat is evenly distributed,

00:15:48.950 --> 00:15:50.710
so the rice will be well-cooked.

00:15:50.820 --> 00:15:52.850
Oh, you didn't know that?

00:15:53.330 --> 00:15:55.120
You think only you know?

00:15:55.200 --> 00:15:56.390
Of course!

00:15:56.530 --> 00:15:57.980
It's the most basic of basics.

00:15:58.080 --> 00:15:59.700
Silang, don't stir it.

00:16:00.570 --> 00:16:01.270
Why not?

00:16:01.590 --> 00:16:02.970
If you stir it while cooking,

00:16:03.070 --> 00:16:03.760
the rice will be over cooked

00:16:03.810 --> 00:16:04.950
And it will ruin the taste.

00:16:05.470 --> 00:16:06.720
You didn't know that?

00:16:06.830 --> 00:16:08.160
It's the most basic of basics!

00:16:12.900 --> 00:16:14.790
These brats know nothing.

00:16:15.050 --> 00:16:16.670
They won't eat anything

00:16:16.760 --> 00:16:17.940
other than my red congee.

00:16:19.930 --> 00:16:20.990
Master Gien,

00:16:21.040 --> 00:16:21.780
where's the red congee?

00:16:21.830 --> 00:16:23.300
What are you doing?

00:16:23.730 --> 00:16:25.590
Father, mother,

00:16:26.150 --> 00:16:27.340
our guests are making breakfast today.

00:16:27.390 --> 00:16:28.510
They want to thank us.

00:16:28.730 --> 00:16:30.870
So they're making congee for us.

00:16:32.120 --> 00:16:34.680
It's not Master Gien's congee?

00:16:35.880 --> 00:16:37.370
I don't want to eat anything

00:16:37.420 --> 00:16:38.770
if it's not his.

00:16:40.400 --> 00:16:41.630
Me neither.

00:16:43.710 --> 00:16:44.470
I will...

00:16:46.160 --> 00:16:47.040
I'll eat it.

00:16:49.060 --> 00:16:50.110
It's ready.

00:16:51.630 --> 00:16:52.610
To show you my thanks,

00:16:52.790 --> 00:16:54.510
I made congee.

00:16:55.030 --> 00:16:56.710
Please, have some.

00:17:20.390 --> 00:17:21.070
That is...

00:17:24.600 --> 00:17:26.990
It's a rainbow!

00:17:27.580 --> 00:17:29.230
Yes. This congee has five different colors,

00:17:29.280 --> 00:17:30.780
making it look like a rainbow.

00:17:31.330 --> 00:17:34.260
A special rainbow congee!

00:17:35.170 --> 00:17:37.180
Please try the red one first.

00:18:08.480 --> 00:18:10.870
I feel more comfortable.

00:18:12.040 --> 00:18:13.510
This is wonderful!

00:18:14.380 --> 00:18:15.720
The red color is derived from perilla frutescens,

00:18:15.930 --> 00:18:18.560
which stimulates your appetite

00:18:18.670 --> 00:18:20.940
and cleanses all the poison in the body.

00:18:23.200 --> 00:18:25.150
It cleanses poison!

00:18:26.500 --> 00:18:28.410
What? It can't be!

00:18:28.870 --> 00:18:30.600
Next is the green one.

00:18:30.700 --> 00:18:31.780
Eat as much as you can!

00:18:33.680 --> 00:18:34.870
The color comes from mung bean,

00:18:35.340 --> 00:18:36.900
an antidote to poison.

00:18:37.290 --> 00:18:38.930
It can balance your body.

00:18:42.790 --> 00:18:43.820
The yellow part is pumpkin.

00:18:44.300 --> 00:18:47.210
Its nutrients make it ideal

00:18:47.500 --> 00:18:47.890
for those with weak organs,

00:18:47.940 --> 00:18:48.940
recovering from an illness.

00:18:49.370 --> 00:18:52.880
The white one is pine cone,

00:18:53.070 --> 00:18:54.530
which supplements your body organs.

00:18:54.840 --> 00:18:57.250
The brown longan warms your body to
speed up healing.

00:19:11.300 --> 00:19:12.030
You all look so much better!

00:19:12.110 --> 00:19:14.970
I'm refreshed.

00:19:15.340 --> 00:19:17.350
I feel so alive!

00:19:18.240 --> 00:19:19.280
My introduction has finished.

00:19:19.580 --> 00:19:21.770
The poison that was in your body

00:19:21.910 --> 00:19:22.540
has now been cleared!

00:19:23.400 --> 00:19:24.460
Poison?

00:19:24.800 --> 00:19:26.820
Yes. There was poison

00:19:26.950 --> 00:19:28.290
in the red congee.

00:19:29.110 --> 00:19:30.790
Isn't that right, Master Gien?

00:19:32.070 --> 00:19:33.460
What are you talking about?

00:19:33.910 --> 00:19:34.430
Gien,

00:19:34.990 --> 00:19:36.580
this is the poison you used!

00:19:37.740 --> 00:19:39.390
This red color comes from Chizo mushroom,

00:19:39.660 --> 00:19:41.620
which is rare

00:19:41.750 --> 00:19:43.200
and horribly poisonous.

00:19:43.800 --> 00:19:44.860
If you eat it for a long time,

00:19:45.140 --> 00:19:46.640
you gradually lose energy and spirit,

00:19:46.990 --> 00:19:49.390
Eventually, you lose your mind.

00:19:50.070 --> 00:19:51.480
It's addictive like drug.

00:19:51.530 --> 00:19:52.570
Once you take it,

00:19:52.730 --> 00:19:53.570
you rely on it

00:19:53.620 --> 00:19:54.490
and feel awful without it.

00:19:55.700 --> 00:19:57.080
You used this poisonous mushroom

00:19:57.130 --> 00:19:58.480
to make the congee

00:19:58.820 --> 00:20:01.280
and take over all the wealth in this house!

00:20:02.080 --> 00:20:02.590
Cooking should

00:20:02.790 --> 00:20:04.660
bring happiness.

00:20:05.210 --> 00:20:07.420
But you used your cooking skills

00:20:07.470 --> 00:20:08.460
to ruin the lives of others

00:20:08.830 --> 00:20:11.140
for your own greedy ends.

00:20:13.050 --> 00:20:15.160
You don't have the right to be a chef!

00:20:16.620 --> 00:20:17.750
This is ridiculous!

00:20:18.710 --> 00:20:19.760
You have no evidence

00:20:19.800 --> 00:20:20.690
to prove your lies.

00:20:21.120 --> 00:20:22.270
Are you going to believe

00:20:22.320 --> 00:20:23.660
the accusations of a child?

00:20:24.400 --> 00:20:25.780
What are you talking about?

00:20:26.040 --> 00:20:28.170
Mao is no ordinary kid.

00:20:28.300 --> 00:20:29.500
This child is actually...

00:20:29.680 --> 00:20:33.020
(Super)

00:20:33.860 --> 00:20:36.430
The youngest Super Chef in history.

00:20:37.450 --> 00:20:38.660
Liu Mao Xing!

00:20:39.760 --> 00:20:41.240
A super chef!

00:20:41.750 --> 00:20:43.880
I was so close...

00:20:44.830 --> 00:20:45.810
Hold it right there!

00:20:47.630 --> 00:20:49.460
Let me go, you stupid brat!

00:20:49.510 --> 00:20:50.850
No way!

00:20:50.900 --> 00:20:52.330
Let me handle this!

00:20:55.100 --> 00:20:56.860
What did you do, you little...

00:21:03.530 --> 00:21:04.830
I shoved some firecrackers

00:21:04.880 --> 00:21:06.620
down his back

00:21:07.360 --> 00:21:09.240
to celebrate this day!

00:21:17.260 --> 00:21:18.950
We should be on our way.

00:21:20.660 --> 00:21:22.720
I don't know how to thank you.

00:21:23.410 --> 00:21:25.000
Thank you, Super Chef.

00:21:25.460 --> 00:21:28.310
Thank you for making delicious food for us.

00:21:28.630 --> 00:21:29.310
Not at all...

00:21:30.020 --> 00:21:30.940
Father, Mao taught me how to cook

00:21:31.250 --> 00:21:34.410
some delicious dishes.

00:21:34.680 --> 00:21:36.060
Can I cook for you some time?

00:21:36.170 --> 00:21:36.820
Sure.

00:21:37.340 --> 00:21:39.050
You can become

00:21:39.100 --> 00:21:40.340
our new chef.

00:21:44.570 --> 00:21:45.750
Mao!

00:21:46.170 --> 00:21:49.720
Silang! Meili!

00:21:49.930 --> 00:21:51.460
Take care!

00:23:15.140 --> 00:23:18.360
Preview of the next episode

00:23:18.360 --> 00:23:20.398
Ah, I'm so full.

00:23:20.481 --> 00:23:23.860
Eating other people's food once in a while
is also a part of the training.

00:23:23.985 --> 00:23:25.903
What? There is no money?

00:23:25.987 --> 00:23:27.322
Dropped?

00:23:27.860 --> 00:23:29.493
Next episode, Chūka Ichiban!

00:23:29.493 --> 00:23:32.160
The Bridge of Love: Galaxy Noodles

00:23:32.285 --> 00:23:33.745
It will definitely be interesting!
